WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:04.700
You must have nothing to occupy 
you until the talks end.

00:04.970 --> 00:09.390
Please, have a look around 
our palace in the meantime.

00:09.390 --> 00:12.350
I'll summon someone to guide you.

00:12.610 --> 00:14.080
U-Um...

00:14.080 --> 00:15.380
Please wait.

00:16.710 --> 00:21.970
If the acting queen of Ozmargo 
needs a guide, then allow me,

00:23.520 --> 00:25.000
Mother.

01:55.010 --> 02:00.010
Blessings and a Vow for the Future

02:00.370 --> 02:04.050
Tetra! What are you doing here?

02:05.020 --> 02:08.030
Th-This is my fourth daughter, Tetra.

02:08.030 --> 02:10.970
She will accompany you through the palace.

02:11.520 --> 02:13.810
Now, if you'll excuse me.

02:14.950 --> 02:15.990
Um...

02:16.560 --> 02:19.010
Okay. Nice to meet you, Tetra.

02:19.010 --> 02:19.480
Ugly!

02:19.480 --> 02:20.090
Wha?!

02:20.090 --> 02:20.910
What?!

02:20.910 --> 02:25.550
I've never seen a human before, 
but you're as hideous as everyone says.

02:25.950 --> 02:29.130
No wonder my mother doesn't 
want to let you hold Calcara.

02:29.130 --> 02:32.660
Where are your manners?! 
You owe Sari an apology!

02:32.950 --> 02:35.090
Servants should know their place.

02:35.090 --> 02:38.220
So hold your tongues, 
you cheeky little blobs.

02:38.220 --> 02:39.670
"Blobs"?!

02:39.120 --> 02:40.110
Wait.

02:40.110 --> 02:43.820
So Queen Calra really doesn't 
want me to perform the ri—

02:43.820 --> 02:45.600
Of course she doesn't.

02:45.600 --> 02:48.970
No mother wants to let an 
ugly freak touch her baby.

02:49.230 --> 02:52.220
Don't get ideas above your station, ugly.

02:52.950 --> 02:55.060
I knew it.

02:55.440 --> 02:56.970
What should I do?

02:57.900 --> 03:01.160
<i>I</i> might be able to pull 
some strings for you.

03:01.160 --> 03:02.020
Huh?

03:03.220 --> 03:05.330
Now, listen closely, Sariphi.

03:05.610 --> 03:08.130
I'm going to throw this stone.

03:08.130 --> 03:10.670
You must catch it and bring it back to me.

03:10.670 --> 03:14.300
Don't be ridiculous! Sari's no dog!

03:14.300 --> 03:16.250
Are you sure you want to 
take that tone with me?

03:16.670 --> 03:22.230
If you become my minion, I'll ask my mother 
to let you perform the rite of blessing.

03:22.580 --> 03:27.560
So if you want to win her favor, 
start by doing as I say.

03:27.560 --> 03:28.800
Now fetch!

03:29.150 --> 03:31.840
We don't have time to play 
along with these childish games!

03:31.840 --> 03:36.650
Oh, and that stone is a national treasure 
from my mother's trousseau.

03:39.980 --> 03:41.730
Look at you run.

03:42.080 --> 03:43.660
Now, what should I do nex—

03:44.370 --> 03:49.400
Here. You should be more careful 
with your mom's jewelry.

03:50.570 --> 03:54.790
What? Don't tell me what to do, minion.

03:54.790 --> 03:56.230
But, Tetra—

03:56.230 --> 03:58.720
How impudent! Address me as "Your Highness"!

03:58.720 --> 04:00.420
Now, on to your next task!

04:02.260 --> 04:06.180
Who's been nibbling at tonight's desserts?!

04:05.390 --> 04:06.350
<b>SNEAK    SNEAK</b>

04:05.390 --> 04:06.350
<b>SNEAK    SNEAK</b>

04:06.050 --> 04:08.890
<b>RUMBLE</b>

04:06.050 --> 04:08.890
<b>RUMBLE</b>

04:06.910 --> 04:09.530
Hm... This is so-so.

04:09.530 --> 04:12.110
Now, how about this?!

04:13.390 --> 04:15.140
And this?!

04:15.360 --> 04:17.480
And... this?!

04:18.550 --> 04:20.790
What, do you admit defeat already?

04:21.360 --> 04:24.250
Yup. What should we play next?

04:25.590 --> 04:29.610
Oh, so these orders are just games to you?

04:30.760 --> 04:33.540
A horse! Your next task is to be my horse!

04:33.850 --> 04:36.790
Get down on all fours, and let me ride you!

04:36.790 --> 04:41.130
Kn-Knock it off! Sari's not your toy!

04:41.130 --> 04:41.870
Toy!

04:42.190 --> 04:43.740
Here. Climb aboard.

04:44.620 --> 04:45.370
Wha...

04:45.640 --> 04:48.660
What's wrong with you? Have you no pride?!

04:48.660 --> 04:51.580
Are you that desperate to 
curry favor with my mother?!

04:51.580 --> 04:52.930
Your mother?

04:52.930 --> 04:56.870
Oh, that's right. I was having so 
much fun, it slipped my mind.

04:58.390 --> 04:59.510
Hey, wai—

04:59.510 --> 05:01.660
Giddyup!

05:09.640 --> 05:13.060
Are you stupid, as well as ugly?

05:13.060 --> 05:15.110
Horses don't walk on two legs.

05:15.110 --> 05:16.200
Oh, you're right.

05:17.340 --> 05:19.410
You really are an idiot.

05:19.870 --> 05:24.310
Buttering me up won't improve 
your chances with my mother.

05:24.790 --> 05:27.380
She only cares about my little brother.

05:27.930 --> 05:29.950
I don't matter to her.

05:30.500 --> 05:35.050
In fact, she sees me as 
a disobedient nuisance.

05:36.000 --> 05:39.580
I know Calcara is more important.

05:40.050 --> 05:42.270
He's the heir my parents have always wanted.

05:43.420 --> 05:46.370
All three of my elder 
sisters were married off.

05:46.930 --> 05:50.960
And someday, I'll be given to some man 
I don't know in a strange country, too.

05:51.700 --> 05:53.300
Like a sacrifice.

05:54.360 --> 05:59.410
My mother can't wait to get rid of me.

06:00.590 --> 06:02.710
I don't think she does.

06:03.890 --> 06:08.790
People with no love at all 
have darker, colder eyes.

06:10.040 --> 06:12.760
But that wasn't how the queen looked at you.

06:13.710 --> 06:20.440
I'm sure she does love you, but maybe 
she can't figure out how to show it.

06:20.920 --> 06:22.700
Just like you right now.

06:26.350 --> 06:27.650
Your Highness?!

06:27.650 --> 06:29.230
Don't try to sugarcoat things.

06:29.740 --> 06:32.250
I don't want fake sympathy from you.

06:32.650 --> 06:35.240
I know I'm an unwanted child.

06:35.890 --> 06:38.570
I made up my mind a long time ago.

06:39.020 --> 06:41.820
While the king of Ozmargo is here,

06:41.820 --> 06:45.250
I'll outdo myself and give 
my mother one last headache

06:45.930 --> 06:49.640
by jumping off the tallest 
tower in the palace!

06:49.640 --> 06:50.730
Wait!

06:53.940 --> 06:55.890
Another girl?

06:56.530 --> 07:00.400
How long must we wait 
for the birth of an heir?

07:00.670 --> 07:05.610
Do you realize how hard I labored 
to marry you into the royal family?

07:05.610 --> 07:07.900
Don't you dare disgrace me further!

07:08.150 --> 07:09.860
Oh, Calcara.

07:10.320 --> 07:12.590
You are my hope.

07:13.160 --> 07:14.560
Your Majesty!

07:14.560 --> 07:19.440
What are you doing, making such 
a racket? You'll wake Calcara.

07:19.440 --> 07:21.050
I beg your pardon,

07:21.050 --> 07:22.620
but it's about Princess Tetra.

07:26.350 --> 07:28.470
My humble apologies.

07:28.470 --> 07:32.400
I deeply regret these difficulties 
with the sacred rite of blessing.

07:32.400 --> 07:33.420
Princess Tetra!

07:34.020 --> 07:35.090
Tetra?!

07:38.170 --> 07:39.300
Don't come closer!

07:39.800 --> 07:41.360
I'll jump if you do!

07:41.640 --> 07:47.070
You only get one life! 
You shouldn't waste it!

07:47.070 --> 07:48.470
Don't!

07:48.470 --> 07:52.860
Even if I die, someone, 
somewhere is born every day.

07:52.860 --> 07:54.830
That's not what I mean!

07:54.830 --> 07:57.640
If you throw away the life 
your parents gave you—

07:57.640 --> 07:58.830
Don't lecture me!

07:59.480 --> 08:03.520
I didn't get a say in being born,

08:03.520 --> 08:06.300
so what's wrong with choosing 
when I end it for myself?

08:06.750 --> 08:11.380
My life belongs to me! Who are you 
to tell me what to do with it?!

08:12.620 --> 08:15.400
Come down from there, Your Highness.

08:15.920 --> 08:18.940
I'd love to play with you again.

08:19.880 --> 08:21.870
You won't fool me with a lie like—

08:21.870 --> 08:22.840
I mean it.

08:23.430 --> 08:28.230
You're correct that only you have 
the right to decide your future.

08:28.710 --> 08:31.390
So this is just a selfish request from me.

08:34.170 --> 08:37.270
My mother was always weeping.

08:37.950 --> 08:40.240
Don't cry, Mother.

08:40.680 --> 08:44.680
I'm here. I'll always be here for you.

08:45.610 --> 08:50.310
Then Calcara was born, 
and her tears stopped.

08:51.190 --> 08:53.450
I wasn't able to do that.

08:54.230 --> 09:00.380
My birth didn't make a single person happy.

09:01.390 --> 09:04.490
Look at this huge fuss.

09:04.490 --> 09:06.700
People hate me more than ever.

09:07.440 --> 09:08.970
I feel great.

09:08.970 --> 09:11.860
My last act will be the biggest 
payback I could hope for.

09:15.380 --> 09:16.540
Tetra...

09:17.620 --> 09:18.400
Wait!

09:18.990 --> 09:26.550
Your Highness, you said you want to 
jump to make trouble for the queen,

09:26.550 --> 09:28.380
but are you sure it's not the opposite?

09:29.150 --> 09:33.060
Really, you just want your mom to smile.

09:35.120 --> 09:36.100
I...

09:36.900 --> 09:38.080
I...

09:40.420 --> 09:41.450
Tetra!

10:00.030 --> 10:01.370
Your Majesty!

10:05.500 --> 10:06.920
Were you scared?

10:07.680 --> 10:09.700
You won't try this again, will you?

10:10.150 --> 10:12.840
But... But I...

10:14.930 --> 10:16.960
Thou art a sovereign's child.

10:17.440 --> 10:20.420
May thy noble path through life

10:20.940 --> 10:23.890
be peaceful and many times blessed.

10:31.680 --> 10:32.900
Was that...

10:33.230 --> 10:35.040
a blessing?

10:35.040 --> 10:39.440
I'm so glad that you were born.

10:39.750 --> 10:44.360
Otherwise, I would never have 
met a girl as kind as you are.

10:59.750 --> 11:00.830
<i>Tetra...</i>

11:01.340 --> 11:04.670
<i>I've never known her to cry so loudly.</i>

11:05.320 --> 11:07.670
Don't cry, Mother.

11:08.400 --> 11:09.960
Mother...

11:09.960 --> 11:11.980
Don't talk to me right now.

11:12.400 --> 11:15.230
You'll wake Calcara. Go elsewhere.

11:16.280 --> 11:22.940
<i>I was so obsessed with Calcara—
or rather, with my own duties as queen—</i>

11:23.670 --> 11:27.110
<i>that I never even thought 
to embrace her like that.</i>

11:27.880 --> 11:30.280
M-My most sincere apologies!

11:30.590 --> 11:34.870
How could I not only allow this commotion, 
but also tax your holy beast?

11:34.870 --> 11:38.590
I am truly ashamed that you were subjected 
to such an unsightly spectacle.

11:39.100 --> 11:43.040
Did that princess appear 
unsightly in your eyes?

11:43.040 --> 11:43.820
Sire?

11:43.820 --> 11:46.910
I take no interest in your family affairs,

11:47.460 --> 11:50.260
but if you heard her words,

11:50.260 --> 11:54.450
then placating me should not 
be your chief concern.

11:54.970 --> 11:59.860
That is, if you are a father, 
as well as a king.

12:02.560 --> 12:03.500
Sire?

12:13.270 --> 12:14.450
Mother...

12:15.670 --> 12:16.550
I'm so sor—

12:19.660 --> 12:22.650
I'm sorry, Tetra. I'm so sorry.

12:22.650 --> 12:24.750
Forgive your foolish mother.

12:28.750 --> 12:30.570
Mother!

12:31.610 --> 12:34.030
Acting Queen of Ozmargo,

12:34.470 --> 12:39.080
thank you for aiding my 
daughter in my stead.

12:39.080 --> 12:41.020
Though it shames me,

12:41.020 --> 12:43.920
might I presume to ask one more favor of you?

12:48.070 --> 12:52.070
<i>No one gets to decide how they're born.</i>

12:52.780 --> 12:57.510
<i>Birthplace, birth order, and status</i>

12:58.410 --> 13:00.240
<i>are out of all of our hands.</i>

13:01.780 --> 13:03.220
<i>And so, I pray,</i>

13:04.210 --> 13:06.370
<i>wishing that new lives</i>

13:06.370 --> 13:11.800
<i>may at least be peaceful and blessed.</i>

13:16.700 --> 13:18.170
<i>I won't accept her.</i>

13:18.520 --> 13:20.990
<i>I refuse to accept her.</i>

13:21.530 --> 13:27.130
<i>Yet perhaps this girl 
truly can change others.</i>

13:31.320 --> 13:33.950
So you used to be a sacrifice?

13:33.950 --> 13:35.000
Yup.

13:35.000 --> 13:37.260
But you must have hated that, right?

13:37.260 --> 13:41.670
Becoming the queen of beasts must have 
been the only way you could escape.

13:41.670 --> 13:48.520
No. I had no say in anything, 
not even whether I lived or died.

13:49.020 --> 13:51.680
But the first decision I made for myself

13:52.350 --> 13:54.640
was that I wanted to live 
at His Majesty's side.

13:55.140 --> 13:57.410
I guess that's one way to meet someone.

13:57.410 --> 13:59.550
You never know what will 
happen if you keep living.

13:59.550 --> 14:03.210
The future has all kinds of encounters 
in store for you, too, Your Highness.

14:03.210 --> 14:04.760
I wonder.

14:04.760 --> 14:08.520
Oh, that reminds me. The chancellor 
of Ozmargo is awfully young.

14:09.120 --> 14:11.080
He's just my type.

14:11.080 --> 14:11.940
What?!

14:11.940 --> 14:14.670
What? Is he already spoken for?

14:14.670 --> 14:18.920
I... I don't think so, 
but I wouldn't recommend him.

14:18.920 --> 14:19.780
Wouldn't.

14:19.780 --> 14:22.640
Still, he's a Jackalian.

14:22.640 --> 14:25.860
If we married, my Felidian 
blood would lose out,

14:25.860 --> 14:28.390
so our children would be Jackalians, too.

14:28.390 --> 14:31.590
Huh? You mean they wouldn't 
be half and half?

14:31.600 --> 14:37.810
<b>m -46 -13 l -29 -28 6 -37 28 -36 28 -1 -23 15</b>

14:31.600 --> 14:37.810
<b>The Wonders
of Beasts</b>

14:31.830 --> 14:34.260
That does happen sometimes,

14:34.260 --> 14:37.800
but usually, children take after the 
parent with the stronger bloodline.

14:37.800 --> 14:39.350
Really?

14:39.350 --> 14:41.480
You don't even know <i>that</i>?

14:41.480 --> 14:45.030
If you're going to be queen, you'll have 
to bear the king's children someday.

14:45.730 --> 14:49.250
<i>His Majesty's... Oh.</i>

14:50.160 --> 14:52.360
I guess you're right.

14:52.830 --> 14:54.790
<b>BLUUUSH</b>

14:55.050 --> 14:59.010
Don't start acting bashful now! 
You'll give me secondhand embarrassment!

15:01.920 --> 15:05.230
<i>I guess I'd never thought 
it through that far.</i>

15:06.200 --> 15:11.650
<i>Doing my duty so I could stay with His 
Majesty was all I could think about.</i>

15:12.420 --> 15:13.930
<i>But if...</i>

15:15.200 --> 15:20.140
<i>if I could start a real family 
with him someday, then...</i>

15:22.290 --> 15:24.870
<i>What sorts of challenges would we face?</i>

15:25.440 --> 15:29.180
<i>His Majesty suffers because 
of his own mixed blood.</i>

15:29.180 --> 15:33.250
<i>How does he feel about the legacy 
our relationship might leave?</i>

15:34.720 --> 15:37.280
<i>Does he want that to happen?</i>

15:47.450 --> 15:49.810
What's the matter, sire?

15:50.550 --> 15:54.620
Sariphi, I have something to tell you.

16:00.280 --> 16:03.640
We should be safe from prying eyes here.

16:06.450 --> 16:09.390
What do you want to tell me?

16:09.390 --> 16:12.710
Before I speak, let me ask you something.

16:13.550 --> 16:17.670
As king, I am duty bound 
to produce an heir one day.

16:18.050 --> 16:20.370
Do you understand that?

16:21.610 --> 16:22.460
Yes.

16:23.770 --> 16:27.910
The true royal line of Ozmargo, 
the blood of the kings of beasts,

16:27.910 --> 16:33.190
mingles with no other strain, 
passing unchanged to our children.

16:33.600 --> 16:38.580
That is why we have continued to reign 
over this realm of many peoples.

16:39.440 --> 16:42.270
But the blood in my veins is... different.

16:43.230 --> 16:48.210
I am not confident that I can 
love a child born of my blood.

16:48.680 --> 16:50.030
I was...

16:50.030 --> 16:54.210
No, I don't recall my 
parents loving me, either.

16:54.840 --> 17:00.500
By the time of my earliest memories, 
I had no mother and no siblings.

17:00.500 --> 17:04.410
My father, the previous king, 
was my only relative,

17:04.910 --> 17:07.390
and he was harsh with me.

17:07.620 --> 17:09.080
Father!

17:09.080 --> 17:13.040
Father, I've learned all 
the ancient beast runes!

17:13.340 --> 17:17.250
All royals learn to be both 
warriors and scholars.

17:17.250 --> 17:19.810
Do not boast of your every achievement!

17:20.430 --> 17:25.320
And at times, my father 
imprisoned me in a small cell.

17:25.320 --> 17:29.590
Father, let me out! Father!

17:29.590 --> 17:30.900
Father!

17:30.010 --> 17:33.170
In time, his motive made itself clear.

17:33.510 --> 17:36.830
<i>I mustn't let anyone see me in this form.</i>

17:37.440 --> 17:40.600
<i>Father is protecting me.</i>

17:41.270 --> 17:44.720
He neither praised nor coddled me.

17:45.120 --> 17:49.670
I felt sure he meant to 
raise me into a fine king.

17:50.160 --> 17:53.680
I believed that love 
underpinned all his actions.

17:54.540 --> 17:55.560
And then,

17:57.120 --> 18:00.220
one day, my father fell ill.

18:01.850 --> 18:06.960
My strict and mighty father was 
wasting away. He didn't have long.

18:07.510 --> 18:11.580
Although saddened, 
I entertained a faint hope

18:12.390 --> 18:17.190
that at the bitter end, 
even my hard-hearted father

18:17.190 --> 18:20.030
would hold me tight and 
tell me that he loved me.

18:20.030 --> 18:23.410
So, I have come... to the end.

18:23.930 --> 18:24.950
Father!

18:24.950 --> 18:26.990
I regret...

18:27.330 --> 18:30.330
that I will leave you... when I die.

18:30.330 --> 18:31.290
Fath—

18:32.590 --> 18:34.040
How mortifying...

18:34.800 --> 18:40.800
Oh, how mortifying it is to die 
and pass my throne to <i>you</i>!

18:40.800 --> 18:45.710
How I loathe the filthy blood in your veins!

18:45.710 --> 18:51.360
I have always despised you! 
Detested you! Hated you!

18:51.360 --> 18:56.710
You are an accursed demon child, 
the greatest blot on my line!

18:56.710 --> 18:59.580
One day, your blood will 
bring this realm to ru—

19:06.370 --> 19:10.630
The king remained strong 
and proud in his last illness,

19:10.630 --> 19:14.220
but even he wished to embrace 
his son at the end.

19:14.220 --> 19:16.710
Or so the priests said, 
with tears in their eyes.

19:17.390 --> 19:24.030
I learned later that my father's mind 
had begun ailing long before his body.

19:24.750 --> 19:29.450
The priest who had been his chief 
physician claimed not to know why,

19:29.930 --> 19:34.140
and the fact was buried, 
never revealed to the people.

19:34.140 --> 19:36.780
Your Highness will catch a chill.

19:39.820 --> 19:44.270
He loathed human blood so 
deeply that it drove him mad.

19:44.270 --> 19:46.910
So why did he sire a child with a human?

19:47.450 --> 19:51.020
Why did he never sire a pure-blooded beast?

19:51.360 --> 19:53.460
I never considered those questions.

19:54.240 --> 19:57.630
I merely cursed my own blood.

19:58.190 --> 20:03.590
The thought of passing it to my heirs 
filled me with nothing but terror.

20:10.350 --> 20:12.360
Forgive me, Sariphi,

20:12.800 --> 20:14.940
for telling you of such unpleasant things.

20:15.720 --> 20:18.310
No, don't apologize.

20:19.050 --> 20:22.270
<i>I still didn't understand.</i>

20:22.780 --> 20:29.440
<i>His Majesty—Leo—doesn't just see 
his human side as weak or inferior.</i>

20:30.130 --> 20:33.020
<i>To him, it truly is a curse.</i>

20:34.140 --> 20:37.800
Don't look so downhearted, Sariphi.

20:38.380 --> 20:42.880
Today, another of my fears 
became a thing of the past.

20:42.880 --> 20:43.950
What?

20:43.950 --> 20:47.800
I couldn't choose the blood 
and status I was born with,

20:47.800 --> 20:51.070
but I was able to choose you.

20:51.680 --> 20:55.310
To me, your presence is the true blessing.

20:56.460 --> 21:00.570
No matter what predicament 
my blood places my heirs in,

21:01.410 --> 21:04.550
if they are the children of our union,

21:04.550 --> 21:09.530
then I swear on my name, Leonhart, 
to defend them with all my body and soul.

21:11.000 --> 21:13.290
<i>"Children of our union"?</i>

21:15.150 --> 21:18.760
<i>Then... that means...</i>

21:20.550 --> 21:25.380
When I have become a truly mighty king, 
as I once promised you I would,

21:25.630 --> 21:29.320
I want you beside me as my queen.

21:29.830 --> 21:30.860
Then,

21:31.650 --> 21:35.060
one day, we shall consummate our union.

21:44.500 --> 21:45.260
Yes!

21:46.760 --> 21:52.700
<i>I pray that someday this curse 
will become a sign of blessing.</i>

21:55.520 --> 21:57.580
Are you really leaving already?

21:57.840 --> 22:01.650
Yes. Thank you for everything, 
Te—Your Highness.

22:01.650 --> 22:03.470
"Tetra" is fine.

22:03.840 --> 22:07.470
Come play with me again... Sari.

22:08.930 --> 22:13.130
As her mother, allow me to 
extend the same invitation.

22:13.130 --> 22:17.460
Please, always remain a friend 
to my daughter Tetra.

22:19.880 --> 22:23.600
Calcara can play with us, too, 
once he grows up a little.

22:23.600 --> 22:25.210
I can't wait.

22:25.210 --> 22:28.610
Listen, Calcara. I'm your big sister.

22:29.020 --> 22:31.920
You're the little brother. 
I'm the big sister.

22:32.390 --> 22:34.840
B-Big... shishta.

22:35.320 --> 22:36.640
He talked!

22:36.640 --> 22:38.290
Talked! Talked!

22:38.800 --> 22:41.670
Say it again, Calcara! Say it again!

22:41.670 --> 22:43.280
I want to hear it again!

22:48.010 --> 22:49.560
<i>Everyone</i>

22:50.910 --> 22:52.180
<i>is moving ahead,</i>

22:53.120 --> 22:54.120
<i>step by step.</i>

23:04.120 --> 23:07.000
You only just completed 
your first duty at last.

23:07.950 --> 23:10.180
Don't push yourself too hard. Rest.

23:10.810 --> 23:14.890
R-Right. Thank you.

23:16.820 --> 23:24.280
<i>We managed to take a step forward, 
too, didn't we? A huge stride.</i>

23:25.930 --> 23:27.340
What is the world coming to?!

23:27.340 --> 23:31.940
The king, of all people, slipping out 
for a tryst with a human wench?!

23:31.940 --> 23:34.670
To top it off, they exchanged 
that unspeakable vow!

23:34.670 --> 23:40.050
And now, the leader of her personal 
guard is to be... H-Hyenian?!

23:37.020 --> 23:40.010
Next Episode

23:37.020 --> 23:40.010
A Sympathy Call and a Hyena Guard Captain
